{"server":"en","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-01_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-01","title":"Yesterday, the Chaff Cracked","storyCode":"R8-1","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"304b44d6b30d7045686392f334fe8d2398131dd05f17b33bf6b3161729eee4ff","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Patrol Unit","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"Ngh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"I didn't cut off your hands! Pick yourself up!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Patrol Unit","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"...Don't you dare think this is over!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll cut out your tongue right here, then."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected Patrol Unit","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"Eek!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"...Off he goes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you oka—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"What have you done! Oh, God, Talulah... Look at what you've done!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"Talulah, we'll have to transport the village in two days. Just look at what you've...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"You fought a patrolman! There'll be hell to pay now!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"Letting him beat you was even less of an idea. It's getting late, and he's on the run. If I kill him now, we'll be long gone by the time the others find his remains."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"But that wouldn't solve any of our problems. Once the patrol unit regroups, they'd still come looking for us. They might well be out to get revenge on us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"And yet you did it! Now what do we do!?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"Calm down. They're looking for Infected. They still don't know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't know what?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"They don't know what I'm about to do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey... Talulah!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"It's okay. Come on, I'll walk you back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"Your leg there... It will need special attention to heal."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah. So today's the day you start helping me walk? Always thought I was still in good shape myself. Who'd've guessed I couldn't outrun it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"Talulah, there's something I need to tell you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"What is it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah, good question. Heh, hahah, sorry, I don't remember. Look at me now. Look at my memory..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"That's some impressive forgetfulness, alright."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
